{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1178880/extras/1e765d864880fa70056a0edc1a5cdb23.avif?t=1776408954\" width=616 height=103 /></span><br>A new, remade version of the Panzer Dragoon game \u2013 true to the original, with improved graphics and controls, that suit modern gaming standards! On a far, lone planet, you encounter two dragons awaken from the ancient times. Armed with a deadly gun from the past, and the guidance of your armored blue dragon, you must fulfill your destiny and keep the Prototype Dragon from reaching the Tower or die trying.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pilot through seven unbelievably realistic levels ranging from tropical blue ocean cities to intricate subterranean ruins.<br></li><li>Fight the Prototype Dragon who appears together with evil giant dragonflies, frightening man - sized wasps, giant sandworms, and lethal flying battleships.<br></li><li>Attack enemies approaching from all sides, quickly and without mercy, with improved 360-degree controls and a lock-on targeting.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1178880/extras/7485e22c4c1f7afc089bfe178628f81a.avif?t=1776408954\" width=616 height=103 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"14b53c00b231829db76ffe34adacf1fe78eeed22.jpg","localized_name":"Hello World","name":"Hello World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1178880/14b53c00b231829db76ffe34adacf1fe78eeed22.jpg"},{"icon":"0e7af3060b71cc72a5c307faab8d9fc6f9d84e01.jpg","localized_name":"Drop in the lake","name":"Drop in the lake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1178880/0e7af3060b71cc72a5c307faab8d9fc6f9d84e01.jpg"},{"icon":"d47358e4a95b8010417fbfe5e3d0ba9d0ebbd6de.jpg","localized_name":"Dune","name":"Dune","path":"ht